A||||42||FIEROCIOUS||Northstar in a Fiero. ||||12||
Z||000000||FIEROCIOUS||08-18-2000||03:29 PM||||Does anyone on the forum own a Fiero with a Northstar V8?<P>The reason I ask is, I want aprox. 300HP for my Fiero. <P>I have a 2.8 moded to hell 190HP No good.<P>Upgrade to 3.1 gain 20 HP for 1000.00 No good.<BR>Upgrade to 3.4 gain 30 HP for 1500.00 No good.<BR>Turbo 2.8 gain 50HP and engine heat and reliability problems 500.00 No good.<BR>Supercharged 2.8 gain 50 HP for 3000.00 No good.<BR>Supercharged 3800 260 HP for 4000.00, better but for the price I could do a Northstar with 300 HP.<BR>Small block chevys are too heavy! No good!<P>So if any of you all have built a Northstar I want to become REAL good friends He He He... ||||reg||12
