Z||000008||FIEROCIOUS||08-18-2000||11:08 PM||||Ecellent...Excellent...Excellent.<BR>I'm happy as a rancher in a sheep herd!<BR>Yee Haw!<BR>Great pics Keep em come'in!<BR>I'd like to see some from the bottom or with the engine out!<BR>I didn't think anyone on the forum had info on the northstar fiero's<P>tgowens thanks for the contact!<P>Right, trigger! (sarcasticly) <P>Anyone know what shock they use for the hood (part number) and how they attach it?<P>I plan on getting all the little stuff done while I save for the motor!<P>THANKYOU ALL! let's get some more info for those who are concidering the Northstar!<BR>We all need one of these puppies!<BR>||||reg||1
