Z||000042||FIEROCIOUS||08-29-2000||03:30 PM||||Nope never been or talked to EIP tunning so your probably right! That kills the idea for a supercharger?<P>Terryk thank you for your thoughts it means quite alot because I respect your opinion!<P>I plan on useing the 4T80E tranny. Cost is a concern but around here the SC3800 are few and far in-between. Northstars are a little easier to get a hold of.<BR>Cost for either is about the same. Ease of instalation? don't know about the SC3800, but from what I've heard from people who have done the Northstar swap it is easy even for the unexperienced; I am very capable of this swap! I dig technology and I love SBC but I've been there done that and want to learn more about the electronic side of engines!  <BR>I guess this swap isn't for the mainstream but I still would like to do it!||||reg||1
